  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> &nbsp;<span style=\"color: #000000;\">has released the answer key for the B. Ed. Common Entrance Test (CET-BED)-2026 For Regular, Distance and Shiksha Shastri 02 Years Course 2026</span></span>. Online applying process for Bihar CET B.Ed Online Form 2026 were accepted from 27 April 2026 to 18 May 2026. The Examination was conducted on 07 June 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their Bihar CET B.Ed Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Babasahab Bhimrao Ambedkar University, Muzaffaprur (BRABU)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bihar CET B.Ed Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar B.Ed Combined Entrance Test-CET-2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>27 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>18 May 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>18 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Apply With Late Fee : <strong>19-21 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Edit Form &amp; Last Date of Payment : <strong>22-23 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>07 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>08 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card <strong>: 30 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Result Declared&nbsp;<strong>19 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, Other State Candidate : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>1000/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">EWS, BC, EBC, Female :<b> Rs. 750/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST Candidates : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>500/-&nbsp;</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking, E Challan, E Wallet, Cash Card Fee Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bihar CET B.Ed Admissions 2026 : Age Limit</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>As Per BRABU Rules</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar CET B.Ed Admissions 2026 : Course Details</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Course Name&nbsp;</strong></span>: B. Ed. Common Entrance Test (CET-BED)-2026 For Regular, Distance and Shiksha Shastri 02 Years Course 2026.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Exam Conduct</span>&nbsp;</strong>: Babasahab Bhimrao Ambedkar University, Muzaffaprur (BRABU)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bihar CET B.Ed Admissions 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6594%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Course&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.3406%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6594%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Regular Education Mode</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.3406%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have at least 50% marks either in the Bachelor’s Degree (10+2+3) and/ or Master’s Degree in Science/ Social Science/ Humanity/ Commerce or Bachelors in Engineering/ Technology with specialization in Science and Mathematics with 55% marks or any other qualification equivalent thereto, are eligible for admission test to the B.Ed. Programme will be eligible for this admission.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6594%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Shiksha Shastri </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.3406%;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have least 50% marks either in the Bachelor’s Degree (10+2+3) with Sanskrit (as the main subject) and Master’s Degree in Sanskrit / Archarya in traditional Sanskrit Shastra with 50% marks or any other qualification equivalent thereto are eligible to appear in admission test for the Shiksha Shastri (B.Ed.) programme will be eligible for this admission.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have Shastri B.A. (Including Sanskrit Subject) with minimum 50% marks by recognized University or Examination Department with two-year course, Acharya (First Year) MA (Sanskrit) must pass examination (bridge Corse) for first year. In percentage determination Acharya First Year or MA first year marks will not be helpful will be eligible for this admission.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bihar CET B.Ed Admissions 2026 : List of Participating University</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Aryabhatt Knowledge University, Patna</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Babasaheb Bimrao Ambedkar Bihar University, Muzaffarpur</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bhupendra Narayan Mandal University, Madhepura</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Jai Prakash University, Chapra</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Kameshwar Singh Darbhanga Sanskrit University, Darbhanga</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Lalit Narayan Mithila University, Darbhanga</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Magadh University, Bodh Gaya</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maulana Mazharul Haque Arabic and Persian University, Patna</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Munger University, Munger</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Patliputra University, Patna</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Patna University, Patna</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Purnea University, Purnea</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Tilka Manjhi Bhagalpur Unviersity, Bhagalpur</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Veer Kunwar Singh University, Ara</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar CET B.Ed Admissions Answer Key 2026 : How To Download</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Check the <strong>Important Links</strong> section below</span></li